# The standard database archives ARE tracked in git (decision: commit via git).
# Each is Odoo's own backup format — a dump.sql plus a filestore — zipped.
# Do not ignore *.zip here.
#
# Extracted or raw dumps are not tracked: they are large, temporary, and the zip
# is the artifact of record.
*.sql
*.sql.gz
*.dump
!linkederp-standard-*.zip
extracted/
